<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50508" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰνδικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <u>Indian</u>: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Ἰ. χώρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.98
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					1.10
				</span></i>
			:—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰνδίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				17.377
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰνδικὸν φάρμακον</span>
			<i>a</i> kind of <i>pepper</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.81
			</span></i>; but, <i>indigo</i> (cf. infr. <i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHolm.</u>
				11.2
			</span></i>; also called <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. μέλαν</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> the plant
				<i>indigo, Indigofera tinctoria</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.92
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> name of an
				<i>eye-salve</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.780
			</span></i>, al.</div>
